{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22905","headline":"偶然二首 一 · 白居易","name":"偶然二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚怀邪乱灵均直，放弃合宜何恻恻。\n汉文明圣贾生贤，谪向长沙堪叹息。\n人事多端何足怪，天文至信犹差忒。\n月离于毕合滂沱，有时不雨何能测。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}